    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4f3d660fed2c58e64d5634",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗同学奔跑时散发的光辉，\n可以说是压倒性地强烈，\n而且……相当不寻常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43b6f7af3377183e629f95cac2439ffb353228ae8c58dc71208580db62b16dd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
