      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然听起来可能有点奇怪……\n但我觉得那是“注定会名垂青史的光辉”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25352e36e7f738a82ace66352d3e207249052a000d899e47f297ff13e1ffd57",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
